etwork Boundary Protection:** Requests cannot be routed to internal network infrastructure or cloud metadata endpoints (`169.254.169.254`), mitigating SSRF (CWE-918).\\n\\n#### Conclusion:\\nThe webhook implementation enforces strong perimeter controls and allowlisting.\"}\n        ]\n    }\n]\n\n# Write to data/custom_cot/security_cot.jsonl\noutput_file = r\"c:\\Users\\k4ran\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\smartAGENT\\data\\custom_cot\\security_cot.jsonl\"\nwith open(output_file, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    for rec in vulnerable_records:\n        f.write(json.dumps(rec, ensure_ascii=False) + \"\\n\")\n    for rec in benign_records:\n        f.write(json.dumps(rec, ensure_ascii=False) + \"\\n\")\n\nprint(f\"[✓] Wrote {len(vulnerable_records)} vulnerability CoT + {len(benign_records)} benign CoT records to {output_file}\")\n","Description":"Generate balanced security CoT and benign records for security_cot.jsonl","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\k4ran\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\e2c1cf9f-2dff-4bf4-a974-ef410441acfa\\scratch\\generate_balanced_cot.py","toolAction":"Creating balanced dataset script","toolSummary":"Write generate_balanced_cot.py"}}]}
